"""
DCA categorical geohash waterfall — segmented cohorts with blacklist actioning.

Mirrors categorical_gh_onb_decline_itcry.py structure; DCA cohort and fraud flags follow
dca_geohash_categorical_analysis.py.

- Global exclusion: (1) geo hotspot blacklist type BL (default 572) on gh5/gh6;
  (2) CATEGORICALGEOHASH (938) with reason DCAONBOARDINGDECLINE on gh5/gh6.
- Per-pass exclusion: existing type-938 geohashes for that pass's reason only.
- Waterfall: GH6 then GH5 with MIN_DISTINCT_USERS / MIN_PRECISION (L1/L1SR precision).
- API: one POST per geohash with CATEGORICALGEOHASH + pass reason key.

Segments (DCA CURRENT product 1150, VKYC_COMPLETED, latest onboarding geohash):
  1) count_of_users_on_devices >= 2  -> DCAMULTIUSERDEVICE
  2) Udyam registration date = onboarding date (Hyperverge vs druid CURRENT) -> DCAUDYAMSAMEDAYONBOARDING
  3) >= 1 reverse contact where uuid_saved_by is MHA L1 (credit) or L1SR -> DCAL1RCVKYCREVIEW

No ITC RED/YELLOW filter (unlike DSA savings reference).
"""

